#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:30
msgid "Screenshot"
msgstr "Skärmbild"

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:41
msgid "Multiple Formats"
msgstr "Flera format"

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:42
msgid ""
"Picard supports all popular music formats, including MP3, FLAC, OGG, M4A,"
" WMA, WAV, and more."
msgstr ""
"Picard stöder alla vanliga musikformat, bland annat MP3, FLAC, OGG, M4A, WMA "
"och WAV."

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:49
msgid "Comprehensive Database"
msgstr "Omfattande databas"

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:58
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Picard uses the open and community-maintained {url|MusicBrainz} database "
"to provide accurate information about millions of music releases."
msgstr ""
"Picard använder den öppna och gemenskapsunderhållna databasen "
"{url|MusicBrainz} för att ge korrekt information om miljontals musikutgåvor."

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:66
msgid "AcoustID"
msgstr "AcoustID"

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:75
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Picard uses {url|AcoustID} audio fingerprints, allowing files to be "
"identified by the actual music, even if they have no metadata."
msgstr ""
"Picard använder ljudfingeravtryck från {url|AcoustID} för att identifiera "
"filer utifrån själva musiken, även om de saknar metadata."

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:85
msgid "CD Lookups"
msgstr "CD-uppslagning"

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:86
msgid "Picard can lookup entire music CDs with a click."
msgstr "Picard kan slå upp en hel musik-CD med ett klick."

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:93
msgid "Open Source"
msgstr "Öppen källkod"

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:100
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Picard is licensed under {urlgpl|GPL 2.0 or later}, and is hosted on "
"{urlgithub|GitHub} where it’s\n"
"                actively developed by some awesome developers."
msgstr ""
"Picard licensieras under {urlgpl|GPL 2.0 eller senare} och finns på "
"{urlgithub|GitHub}, där det\n"
"                utvecklas aktivt av skickliga utvecklare."

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:109
msgid "Cover Art"
msgstr "Omslagsbilder"

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:110
msgid "Picard can find and download the correct cover art for your albums."
msgstr "Picard kan hitta och hämta rätt omslagsbilder för dina album."

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:119
msgid "Scripting"
msgstr "Skript"

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:120
msgid ""
"A flexible but easy to learn scripting language allows you to exactly "
"specify how your music files will be named and how the tags will look "
"like."
msgstr ""
"Med ett flexibelt men lättlärt skriptspråk kan du ange exakt hur "
"musikfilerna ska namnges och hur taggarna ska utformas."

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:127
msgid "Plugin Support"
msgstr "Stöd för insticksmoduler"

#: website/frontend/templates/index.html:129
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If you need a particular feature, you can choose from a selection of "
"{url|available plugins} or write\n"
"                your own."
msgstr ""
"Om du behöver en viss funktion kan du välja bland {url|tillgängliga "
"insticksmoduler} eller skriva\n"
"                en egen."

